WEBVTT

00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:09.844
<v><b>David:</b></v> I opened the door of my flat and turned on the light.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.919
My flat looked very different.

00:00:26.932 --> 00:00:27.664
Oh no!

00:00:31.359 --> 00:00:35.548
There was no TV, and there weren’t any pictures on the walls.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.112
I went into my bedroom.

00:00:47.763 --> 00:00:49.492
My laptop wasn’t there.

00:01:08.517 --> 00:01:12.944
But there was a nice smell: Chanel Number Five.